### 错误标注
1. Porcelain is originated from China → 语态错误，originate 是不及物动词，不用被动；originate in + 地点
2. whose producing history → 用词不地道，改为 production history
3. more than thousands of years → thousands of 本身就是 “数千”，more than 多余
4. held the great uniques of making porcelains → 单词拼写、词义错；unique 是形容词，这里想表达技艺：superb techniques；porcelain 表泛指不可数，不加 s
5. Featuring hard materials, smooth surface → 平行结构缺失，且 material 用词不对，质地是 texture；surface 改为 surfaces
6. In ancient → 介词搭配错误，in ancient times
7. transported oversea → 拼写错误：overseas
8. by Silk Road → 专有名词前加 the，via the Silk Road 更合适
9. a integral → integral 元音开头，用 an
10. culture symbol → 名词修饰错误，cultural symbol
11. craftmen's → 拼写错误：craftsmen

